  "body": "Rather than having to go full on with portable accounts (ie migrating data between instances), portable identities a la bluesky/atproto might be a nice first step to let folks own their domain without running a full matrix server.\n\nSo they would just set up a DNS or well-known on their domain to delegate their domain to a given existing server.\n\nThis would be coupled with pseudo IDs under the hood, presumably.",
